        {
            "block_label": "image",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_197_662_1025_1083.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"67%\" />\n\nRoot node (n rows)\ntwoblock coskewness split\nscore  $ t_{1} = x_{i}^{\\top} w_{1} $, threshold  $ \\tau $\n\n $ t_{1} < \\tau $\n $ t_{1} \\geq \\tau $\n\nLeaf  $ \\ell_{1} $: covariance twoblock\n $ \\hat{y}_{i} = x_{i}^{\\top} B_{\\ell_{1}} $\n $ \\hat{y}_{i} = x_{i}^{\\top} B_{\\ell_{2}} $\n\nleaf coefficients  $ B_{\\ell_{1}} $\n $ \\hat{y}_{i} = x_{i}^{\\top} B_{\\ell_{2}} $\n $ \\hat{y}_{i} = x_{i}^{\\top} B_{\\ell_{2}} $\n\n</div>\n",
